{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-markdown-remark-js","path":"/hitchhikers-guide/apps/docs/content/observatorium/thanos/request_thanos_access.md","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Operate First"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"ae673e82-f3e3-583b-8954-4cf3a7764c02","html":"<h1 id=\"thanos-query-api\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#thanos-query-api\" aria-label=\"thanos query api permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Thanos Query API</h1>\n<p>With Thanos Query access, you will be able to:</p>\n<ol class=\"pf-c-list\">\n<li>Access the <a href=\"https://thanos-query-frontend-opf-observatorium.apps.smaug.na.operate-first.cloud/\">Thanos Query Frontend UI</a></li>\n<li>Access the Thanos metrics programmatically using your OpenShift personal token (<a href=\"thanos_programmatic_access.md\">instructions</a>)</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"steps-to-follow\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#steps-to-follow\" aria-label=\"steps to follow permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Steps to follow</h3>\n<p>To get the specific permissions needed query metrics directly from the Thanos Query API, please follow these steps:</p>\n<ol class=\"pf-c-list\">\n<li>Onboard your project/group to Operate First (<a href=\"https://github.com/operate-first/hitchhikers-guide/blob/main/pages/onboarding_project.ipynb\">guide</a>)</li>\n<li>\n<p>Once your group has been onboarded, add your group to <a href=\"https://github.com/operate-first/apps/blob/master/observatorium/overlays/moc/smaug/thanos/rolebindings/opf-observatorium-view.yaml#L10\">this list</a> in a new line as: <br></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"yaml\"><pre class=\"language-yaml\"><code class=\"language-yaml\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> <span class=\"token key atrule\">kind</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Group\n  <span class=\"token key atrule\">apiGroup</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> rbac.authorization.k8s.io\n  <span class=\"token key atrule\">name</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> MY_GROUP_NAME</code></pre></div>\n<p>and create a PR (Pull Request). You can see an example Pull Request <a href=\"https://github.com/operate-first/apps/pull/1378\">here</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>After your PR is reviewed/merged, you should have access to the Thanos Query Console and API</li>\n</ol>","fields":{"srcLink":"https://github.com/operate-first/apps/blob/master/docs/content/observatorium/thanos/request_thanos_access.md"},"frontmatter":{"title":"","description":null,"extraClasses":null,"banner":null}}},"pageContext":{"id":"ae673e82-f3e3-583b-8954-4cf3a7764c02"}},"staticQueryHashes":["117426894","1764348645","3000541721","3606484676"]}